New code; no code copied from other projects.

Runtime dependencies: aqt-spec (Apache-2.0), mitmproxy (MIT) and its dependencies (among them
cryptography, Apache-2.0 OR BSD-3-Clause; pyOpenSSL, Apache-2.0; h2, MIT).
Runs as external programs (not included, not linked): bubblewrap (LGPL-2.0-or-later),
nftables (GPL-2.0-only), iproute2 (GPL-2.0-or-later).
Test-only: pytest (MIT), jsonschema (MIT), aqt-trail (Apache-2.0).

Ideas only, no code: Anthropic's sandbox-runtime (Apache-2.0; a sandbox without a network whose
only way out is a host proxy), iron-proxy (Apache-2.0; own DNS answers plus nftables against
bypass), OpenSnitch (GPL-3.0; finding the process of a connection through /proc), and mitmproxy's
TLS pass-through example add-on (MIT; pass a host through after the client rejected the CA).
